# ERROR EXAMPLE: Basis set linear dependency
# Dilithium with heavily augmented quintuple-zeta basis set
# The highly diffuse functions on two electropositive Li atoms overlap so strongly
# that the overlap matrix becomes near-singular, causing numerical instability
# ORCA error: "Linear dependency detected" / overlap eigenvalue below threshold
# Fix: Use a smaller basis (cc-pVTZ, aug-cc-pVTZ), or adjust linear dependency
# threshold with %scf LinDepThresh
! HF aug-cc-pV5Z Opt Freq pal16

%maxcore 6000

* xyz 0 1
Li     0.000000    0.000000    0.000000
Li     2.670000    0.000000    0.000000
*
